    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6559" root="حهز" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَسٌ جَهِيزٌ</span></b> , (S, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَهِيزُ الشَّدِّ</span>, (AO, TA,)
<i>A horse quick,</i> or <i>swift, in running:</i> (AO, S:)
or the former, <i>a horse that is light,</i> or <i>active.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْتٌ جَهِيزٌ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجْهِزٌ</span></b> , <i>A quick death.</i> (K.)

